==Battleground==
*8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
*4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 11.33~14.67 seconds<sup>340f~440f</sup>.
*4 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 17.33 seconds<sup>520f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 5.33~6.67 seconds<sup>160f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Pterowl Hazuku]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 82 seconds<sup>2,460f</sup>.
**2 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your goal is to defeat Rajakong in 73 seconds, otherwise you will have to fight both Rajakong and Hazuku, making victory nigh-impossible. As such, [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]] and other [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] or [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayer]] units shine in this stage. The same Behemoth Slayers can also make quick work of the ants, with [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] being the most effective thanks to his [[Zombie Killer]] and [[Massive Damage]]. Once Rajakong is dead, use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to get inside Hazuku's blindspot and kill it effortlessly.

